      "content": "Thanks for that. Quick follow up: I'm also looking at the kinetics of the rearrangement phase. Can you elaborate on how the concentration of these reactants affects the complexity of the flavor compounds produced? Like, does a higher ratio of sugar to protein drastically change the end result?",
